+# Implementation Plan - Fix Duplicate Overlays and Enhance Call Details
+
+The goal is to fix the duplicate call popups shown during and after calls, improve the Permissions screen UI, and enhance the call overlay to show detailed customer information (licenses, invoices, etc.) when a number is found in the CRM.
+
+## User Review Required
+
+> [!IMPORTANT]
+> The new overlay will fetch significantly more data (licenses, quotes, invoices, etc.). I will add a loading state and ensure the overlay remains responsive.
+> I will also add a form to capture the "Why they called" information, which will be synced back to the CRM.
+
+## Proposed Changes
+
+### Core Logic
+
+#### [MODIFY] [CallReceiver.kt](file:///C:/Users/pawan/AndroidStudioProjects/FSSCrm/app/src/main/java/com/fsscrm/network/CallReceiver.kt)
+- Add a debounce mechanism to prevent starting the `CallOverlayService` multiple times for the same state/number within a short timeframe.
+- This will fix the issue of multiple popups appearing simultaneously on certain devices.
+
+#### [MODIFY] [CallOverlayService.kt](file:///C:/Users/pawan/AndroidStudioProjects/FSSCrm/app/src/main/java/com/fsscrm/network/CallOverlayService.kt)
+- Update `CallOverlayContent` to fetch comprehensive lead details if a lead is identified.
+- Fetch licenses, quotations, invoices, and activity history.
+- Update `ActiveCallLayout` and `PostCallLayout` to display these details.
+- Add a "Call Reason" input field when an existing customer calls.
+- Improve the UI styling: reduce font sizes and make layouts more compact and attractive as requested.
+
+### UI Improvements
+
+#### [MODIFY] [PermissionScreen.kt](file:///C:/Users/pawan/AndroidStudioProjects/FSSCrm/app/src/main/java/com/fsscrm/ui/PermissionScreen.kt)
+- Reduce font sizes for titles and descriptions.
+- Use more standard/professional labels for permissions.
+- Improve the overall "attractiveness" of the screen with better spacing and refined styles.
+
+### Data & Networking
+
+#### [MODIFY] [ApiService.kt](file:///C:/Users/pawan/AndroidStudioProjects/FSSCrm/app/src/main/java/com/fsscrm/network/ApiService.kt)
+- Ensure all necessary fields are available in the data classes to support the new overlay details.
+- Add an endpoint or ensure `update_activity.php` can handle the "call reason" submission.
+
+## Verification Plan
+
+### Automated Tests
+- N/A (Manual UI verification on device is more appropriate for overlays).
+
+### Manual Verification
+1. **Double Popup Fix:** Simulate calls and verify only one overlay appears for each state (Ringing, Active, Post-call).
+2. **Permissions Screen:** Verify the new UI design and reduced font sizes.
+3. **Customer Details:** Call from a number already in the CRM and verify that licenses, invoices, and activity history are displayed.
+4. **Call Reason:** Capture a call reason in the overlay and verify it's synced to the server.
